==Strategy==
This stage contains a buffed Aku Cyclone, very difficult [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], additional threatening pushers and, worst of all, two Midnite Ds that eventually stack up. Bring units that prove to be helpful, for brute force is out of the picture. You'll absolutely need a [[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|sniper]] to kill the Midnite Ds, as they'll almost always be hiding behind the Cyclone. Thankfully, the only enemies that respawn indefinitely are weak Crocos and Devil Wives that can be exploited for money.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - A level 40+ Courier is almost necessary here as the only non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] solution to the nasty Reds.
*[[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] - Barrel is [[Immune to Surge]]s, resistant to Aku enemies, has a 60% chance to Pierce [[Shield]]s, and its [[Long Distance]] attacks can hit Aku Cyclone even behind the peons. Make use of each one wisely.
*[[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] - A powerful sniper with a 30% chance to [[Knockback]] Aku enemies, his abilities allow him to deal serious damage against the support and knock back the Cyclone.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] - A great sniper with the [[Savage Blow]] [[Talents|Talent]], she can deal with the Midnite Ds and supporting enemies well.
*[[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] - The best [[Shield Piercing]] Cat you may have up to this point, use him if he is your only reliable Shield Piercer primarily for the Aku Cyclone.
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Bellydance Cat]] - Requires Target Aku. Just like [[Wrath of Hell (Deadly)|Wrath of Hell]], this stage solely consists of enemies within Bellydance Cat's target traits, though beware that dodge is a rather inconsistent ability for such an expensive unit.
*[[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] - Cheaper than Bellydance and doesn't require Research Combos to be spammed, though it cannot dodge Red enemies.
*[[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] - [[Strong Against]] Aku and Immune to Surges. Great for holding ground as long as the Reds are taken care of.
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] - A Boulder boosted with Research [[Cat Combo|Combos]] is here for when all other options of meatshielding fail.
*[[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Deadeye]] - Given the Aku Cyclone's slow speed, Sniper the Deadeye is effective in permanently stalling the cyclone with its Knockback and [[Slow]] abilities. This only works after its shield is pierced.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]] - Strong Against Aku, with Surge Attacks (in [[True Form]]) and 100% Shield Piercing as well as a relatively low cooldown for rapid replacement. Easily removes Aku Cyclone's Shields and deals with other Aku threats well. The only things to watch out are her vulnerabilities to Surges, Red threats and mediocre range. She also cannot control the threats, so additional damage may be necessary to wipe them out.
*[[Hevijak the Wicked (Uber Rare Cat)|Hevijak]] - Has high health and is [[Resistant]] against Red and Aku, tanking hits from Devil Wives' Death Surges and Midnite Ds. His 50% (100% in True Form) Knockback can also keep the Aku Cyclone and other enemies at bay, and his 50% Shield Piercing can remove Midnite Ds and Aku Cyclone's Shields as well.
*[[Iz the Dancer of Grief (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Lady of Mourning]] - Low cost and recharge time for an Uber, 100% chance of piercing Shields and is Immune to Surge. Can easily break Midnite D.s and Aku Cyclone's Shields and delivers high damage to enemies when [[Strengthen|Strengthened]].
*[[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]] - Amazing Slow uptime that can easily deal with everything outside of the Death Surges, but still lasts a while thanks to her incredible health against traited enemies. Just make sure to bring [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing Cats]].
*[[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Death's Daughter Lunacia]] - With great DPS against Aku and especially against Midnite D., her abilities are very helpful in dealing some serious damage to everything, while [[Weaken]]ing the supporting Akus, though keep in mind that her Shield Piercing activation rate is rather low.
*[[Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoru Hanayama]] - With extreme attack power against Aku and 100% Shield Piercing, he can kill the Midnite Ds in one hit and the Aku Cyclone in just a few. Despite his lack of Surge Immunity, he simply has the HP to ignore them. Do keep in mind that he does not target Red enemies and only has 1 knockback, giving him poor survivability should the enemies reach him.
*Talented [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Akuma Hayabusa]] - With his Target Aku and Shield Piercing Talents, Akuma Hayabusa is very viable to stand back and stall the Cyclone and Aku peons with his long range and decent Knockback/Slow uptime, which gets further exemplified with multiple Hayabusas stacked. Do note that he is vulnerable to the Devil Wives' and Condemned Peng's Death Surges, unless you somehow managed to acquire his Ultra Talents before clearing this stage.

